#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0001-A expect=violation domain=APDM
#note "Positive control: the dataset is named APDM but the record carries DOMAIN=DM; the first 4 characters of the dataset name (APDM) do not equal DOMAIN, so the rule fires once for the dataset. Paired with the -valid- twin; first fixture for this id (PLAN-zero-row-routing-rekey.md phase 2)."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset APDM label="Associated Persons Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col APID    type=Char label="Associated Persons Identifier"
col RSUBJID type=Char label="Related Subject Identifier"
col SREL    type=Char label="Subject Relationship"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | AP-001 | 01-701-1015 | MOTHER, BIOLOGICAL
---
